    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEnjoying a picture-postcard setting in one of South Dublin's most desirable locations, No. 23 Killiney Hill Park is a beautifully renovated two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment with a stunning elevated outlook across the treetops of Killiney Hill Park. Positioned on the third floor of this well-established gated development, the apartment offers the opportunity to enjoy Killiney's natural beauty and heritage just moments from the front door.\n\nRecently renovated to a very high standard, the property comes to the market in turnkey condition. The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall with storage, a sleek fitted kitchen with fully integrated appliances, a light-filled living room overlooking the landscaped gardens and Killiney Hill Park, two spacious double bedrooms with built-in storage, the main bedroom with an en suite bathroom, and a guest shower room with a rainfall shower.\n\nOutside, the development is approached through electric gates, with surface-level car parking to the front. The beautifully landscaped private grounds adjoin Killiney Hill Park and are available for residents to enjoy. The property also benefits from a private storage cage within the building, providing useful additional storage.\n\nThe location needs little introduction. Situated off Killiney Hill Road in the heart of Killiney, the property is within a short stroll of Killiney Hill Park, the walks and sea swimming at Killiney Beach, Mister Magpie Café and The Druid's Chair. Fitzpatrick Castle Hotel is next door, offering excellent leisure facilities, a restaurant and The Terrace, where residents can sit out and enjoy a coffee. Killiney DART station and the regular No. 59 bus service provide convenient links to nearby Dalkey and Dún Laoghaire, both of which offer an excellent range of amenities, including restaurants, shops, schools and some of the area's most enjoyable walks.\n*Images of the swimming pool and gym at Fitzpatrick Castle Hotel. Access is subject to club membership and the applicable membership fee."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nA welcoming entrance hall with fitted carpet, hot press, intercom system and a utility area plumbed for a washing machine and vented for a tumble dryer.\n\nKitchen - \nA sleek newly fitted kitchen featuring a range of wall and base units, timber worktops, a four-ring electric hob with overhead extractor, stainless-steel sink, integrated oven and grill, integrated fridge-freezer, integrated dishwasher, bespoke feature lighting and concealed under-cabinet lighting.\n\nLiving Room - \nA bright open-plan living area adjoining the kitchen, flooded with natural light and enjoying superb, elevated views across the landscaped communal gardens to the treetops of Killiney Hill Park. The room also features built-in storage, a decorative fireplace and ceiling lighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nA spacious double bedroom with fitted carpet, built-in wardrobes and a wide window enjoying attractive views towards Killiney Hill Park.\n\nEn-Suite - \nA generously sized en suite bathroom with tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, comprising a full-size bath with shower attachment, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nA well-proportioned double bedroom with fitted carpet, built-in wardrobes and a striking floor-to-ceiling window framing an uninterrupted outlook across the landscaped gardens to Killiney Hill Park beyond.\n\nShower Room - \nWith tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, the shower room comprises a large walk-in enclosure with rainfall showerhead, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Renovated in 2024; designer bespoke kitchen, new doors and bathrooms</li><li>Two bedroom / two-bathroom apartment </li><li>Turn-key condition </li><li>Refurbished common areas</li><li>Elevator </li><li>Landscaped communal garden and grounds </li><li>Proximity to lovely walks over Killiney Hill</li><li>Adjacent to Fitzpatrick Castle Hotel with Leisure Club </li><li>Two bedrooms and two bathrooms </li><li>Ample gated car parking </li><li>Dedicated storage unit in basement</ul>"
      },
